name: Correct architecture locally, review an inactive copy and bind it to a finite study
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_architecture.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks secret-scan
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study
keys: Down Down Down Enter Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | original-context
expect: Alpha
keys: e
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ System overview | editor-ready
keys: Home Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ Alpha client · Role | selected-role
expect-not: g regen
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 edited locally | local-edit-explained
keys: Enter Down
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ External participant | role-choice
expect: Current: process
expect: Tab details
resize: 160x48
live-snap: role-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: role-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: role-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: role-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Enter apply | role-40x12
expect: Tab details
keys: Tab NPage
require-live-snap: 20 external-entity | role-details-40x12
expect: PgUp/Dn read
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE CONTEXT VALUE | choice-owns-save-key
paste-file: @ART/choice-paste.txt
require-live-snap: 20 Use arrows and Enter | choice-owns-paste
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 EDIT CONTEXT COPY | canceled-choice
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_architecture.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
ask: Are local role choices discoverable at all six sizes, with full-value details, visible cancel/apply controls and no model work from paste or hidden shortcuts?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ * Alpha client · Role | applied-role-draft
keys: Up Up Enter C-u
paste-file: @ART/single-line-paste.txt
require-live-snap: 20 Use one line | refused-multiline-name
paste-file: @ART/caller-name.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ * Alpha client · Name | named-caller
keys: Home Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE CONTEXT VALUE | flow-source
expect: Current: api
keys: Down Tab
require-live-snap: 20 Exact value: | flow-choice-details
expect: client
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ * request · Flow source | applied-flow-draft
keys: r
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW CONTEXT CHANGES | reviewed-corrections
expect: Reviewed caller
expect: external-entity
expect: Before:
expect: After:
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_architecture.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
ask: Does review show the exact role, name and endpoint corrections, preserve evidence references, and clearly require saving a separate inactive copy?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Edited copy saved | saved-copy
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_architecture.py @TMP_TARGET @ART saved
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | inspected-copy
keys: d
require-live-snap: 25 No Text changes | loaded-parent-text
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 Matched by exact literal ID. | graph-comparison
expect: Graph
keys: End
live-snap: complete-graph-change
ask: Does the saved comparison expose architecture changes against the exact parent without altering the active context or claiming the original evidence was reverified?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for this study | selected-copy
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | finite-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_architecture.py @TMP_TARGET @ART planned
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | recovered-study
keys: Down Down Down Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | recovered-context
keys: d
require-live-snap: 25 No Text changes | recovered-parent-text
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 Matched by exact literal ID. | recovered-architecture
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_architecture.py @TMP_TARGET @ART resumed
ask: Does no-color restart recover the exact edited copy in the original finite draft, with unchanged source and active context, three unstarted jobs and zero provider requests?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
